      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "排查第一站",
      "items": [
        "kubectl get endpoints：为空 = selector 不匹配或无 Ready Pod",
        "ClusterIP ping 不通、curl 通：VIP 只做 TCP/UDP DNAT",
        "VIP 上没有任何进程监听——包在节点上被直接改写"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "iptables vs ipvs",
      "items": [
        "iptables：DNAT 规则线性匹配，数千条 Service 时变慢",
        "ipvs：内核哈希表 O(1)，支持 rr/lc/sh 等算法",
        "大规模集群首选 ipvs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "集群 DNS",
      "items": [
        "创建 Service 即注册 <svc>.<ns>.svc.cluster.local",
        "Headless 返回所有 Ready Pod IP（多条 A 记录）",
        "StatefulSet 每 Pod 独立域名：web-0.svc.ns.svc.cluster.local"
      ]
    }
